  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the troubadour has become a master of all of his roles. Whenever he prepares a persona, he can choose to prepare 2 personas at once. He may assume either of them or his base persona as a free action usable once per round. If he changes a prepared persona through the quick change class feature, he may choose either of his prepared personas to switch with the new persona.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/troubadour#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
